{
  "version": 2,
  "title": "两包对比",
  "sub": "两个开源包 · 30 天逐日下载叠在一起比",
  "i18n": {
    "en-US": {
      "title": "Compare two",
      "sub": "Two packages · 30 days of daily downloads, overlaid"
    }
  },
  "layout": 42,
  "params": {
    "eco": "npm",
    "pkg": "react",
    "eco2": "npm",
    "pkg2": "vue"
  },
  "ai": {
    "shows": "两个开源包近 30 天逐日下载叠成两条线对比，各自近 7 天下载与一方约为另一方几倍",
    "params": {
      "eco": {
        "kind": "enum",
        "values": {
          "npm": "npm(JavaScript / Node.js)",
          "pypi": "PyPI(Python)",
          "crates": "crates.io(Rust)"
        }
      },
      "pkg": {
        "kind": "value",
        "group": [
          "eco",
          "pkg"
        ],
        "format": "eco 所选生态里开源包的名字：npm 原样照写（全小写，scoped 包带 @scope/，如 @vue/cli）；PyPI / crates.io 不分大小写；Docker Hub 官方镜像只写名字（nginx），其它写 命名空间/仓库（grafana/grafana）；Homebrew 写 formula / cask 名（wget、visual-studio-code）。不确定名字就用默认值",
        "examples": [
          "react",
          "next",
          "@angular/core"
        ]
      },
      "eco2": {
        "kind": "enum",
        "values": {
          "npm": "npm(JavaScript / Node.js)",
          "pypi": "PyPI(Python)",
          "crates": "crates.io(Rust)"
        }
      },
      "pkg2": {
        "kind": "value",
        "group": [
          "eco2",
          "pkg2"
        ],
        "format": "eco2 所选生态里开源包的名字：npm 原样照写（全小写，scoped 包带 @scope/，如 @vue/cli）；PyPI / crates.io 不分大小写；Docker Hub 官方镜像只写名字（nginx），其它写 命名空间/仓库（grafana/grafana）；Homebrew 写 formula / cask 名（wget、visual-studio-code）。不确定名字就用默认值",
        "examples": [
          "vue",
          "svelte",
          "solid-js"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "events": {
    "onClick": "/pkg?eco=${eco}&name=${pkg}",
    "onEdit": "/pick?eco=${eco}&pkg=${pkg}&eco2=${eco2}&pkg2=${pkg2}",
    "_note": "点组件进包 A 的详情页;长按编辑进 /pick 的双槽模式(带 eco2 / pkg2 即双槽),先选「包 A / 包 B」再点选。"
  },
  "canvas": {
    "source": "@[file://rc/cmp.rcn]",
    "depends": [
      {
        "flow": "@[file://flow/cmp.df]",
        "params": {
          "eco": "${eco}",
          "pkg": "${pkg}",
          "eco2": "${eco2}",
          "pkg2": "${pkg2}"
        }
      }
    ],
    "refresh": {
      "_note": "npm / pypistats / crates.io 的逐日统计按天出,Homebrew 统计每天生成一次,Docker Hub 累计拉取是慢变的大数;一小时一刷只为「新的一天出数了能跟上」,更密是白打接口。",
      "interval": [
        "3600"
      ]
    }
  }
}
